{
    "info": {
        "_postman_id": "2d1b3805-9f9e-4a52-84fc-ac86f72642c9",
        "name": "02 - Subscription Plan",
        "description": "Endpoints to manage and purchase pricing plans.",
        "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
    },
    "item": [
        {
            "name": "Get Paged Subscription Plans",
            "event": [
                {
                    "listen": "test",
                    "script": {
                        "exec": [
                            "pm.test(\"Status code is 200\", function () {",
                            "    pm.response.to.have.status(200);",
                            "});",
                            "var jsonData = pm.response.json();",
                            "if (jsonData \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items.length \u003e 0) {",
                            "    pm.environment.set(\"subscriptionPlanId\", jsonData.data.items[0].id);",
                            "    if (jsonData.data.items[0].prices \u0026\u0026 jsonData.data.items[0].prices.length \u003e 0) {",
                            "        pm.environment.set(\"planPriceId\", jsonData.data.items[0].prices[0].id);",
                            "    }",
                            "}"
                        ],
                        "type": "text/javascript"
                    }
                }
            ],
            "request": {
                "auth": {
                    "type": "noauth"
                },
                "description": "### Endpoint Overview\n\nFetches a paginated list of subscription plans with dynamic sorting and filtering.\n\n---\n\n### Available Domain Attributes \u0026 Filter Reference\n\n| Attribute Name | Data Type | Filter Support | Description / Allowed Values |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| `Id` | `int` | Exact | Unique Identifier |\n| `Name` | `string` | Searchable | Plan display name |\n| `Description` | `string` | - | Detailed plan summary |\n| `IsFree` | `bool` | Exact | Free tier indicator |\n| `MaxOwnedGyms` | `int` | Between | Maximum gyms owner can create |\n| `MaxCoaches` | `int` | Between | Max coaches allowed per gym |\n| `MaxMembers` | `int` | Between | Max members allowed per gym |\n| `FeaturesJson` | `string` | - | JSON serialized feature lists |\n| `CreatedOn` | `DateTime` | Between | ISO creation date |\n| `IsActive` | `bool` | Exact | Active status |\n\n---\n\n### Filter Usage Guide (For Request Body)\n\n- **Exact Filters (`exactFilters`):** Pass attribute name with array of string/enum values. Example: `\"exactFilters\": { \"IsFree\": [\"false\"] }`\n- **Between Filters (`betweenFilters`):** Pass attribute name with `min` and `max`. Example: `\"betweenFilters\": { \"MaxOwnedGyms\": { \"min\": \"1\", \"max\": \"10\" } }`",
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                    {
                        "key": "Content-Type",
                        "value": "application/json"
                    }
                ],
                "body": {
                    "mode": "raw",
                    "raw": "{\n  \"pageNumber\": 1,\n  \"pageSize\": 10,\n  \"orderBy\": \"Id\",\n  \"orderDirection\": \"asc\",\n  \"filters\": {\n    \"betweenFilters\": {},\n    \"exactFilters\": {}\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                    "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/SubscriptionPlan",
                    "host": [
                        "{{baseUrl}}"
                    ],
                    "path": [
                        "api",
                        "SubscriptionPlan"
                    ]
                }
            },
            "response": []
        },
